[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3 uid="uid://test_sprite3d_billboard_fixed_y"]

; One variable: the basis of a whole-node FIXED_Y billboard. Godot builds it from the camera's
; axes about world up (`material.cpp:1291-1295`), not from the direction to the camera, so the
; sprites far left and far right of the view face the camera's forward axis, not the camera.
; The middle sprite sits under a parent turned 60 degrees, which the billboard throws away.
; No other scene shows FIXED_Y on a Sprite3D: unit-sprite3d.tscn bills only ENABLED, and
; unit-material-billboard.tscn bills a material surface, not a node.

